  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tanzania Phasing Out Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensure a responsible phasing out of Danish development cooperation by consolidating results and supporting partners&#x2019; sustainability efforts. In this regard, no new partners are included; emphasis is on continuing to deliver results by building on existing activities and to focus on consolidating achievements. In a Tanzanian context, it is assessed fruitful to maintain a balance of partnerships across important actors and sectors during the phasing out and the programme therefore supports civil society (with focus on human rights, good governance and health, including sexual and reproductive health and rights), the private sector (with focus on agri-financing) and the public sector (with focus on health system strengthening and health service delivery).</narrative>
  </description>
